WEBVTT

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:12.290
In both shojo manga and love song lyrics,

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:16.870
it's so radiantly blinding to me,

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:25.080
But no matter what I do, I can't reach it...

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:33.750
Romance Library
Wakana
Hanamichi 
First Love
Mikoto Hoshina

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:36.040
I understand the meaning without
looking it up in the dictionary,

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:36.000
Azure Skies, Fleeting Love.

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:43.870
but it's something that will never be mine.

00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:53.580
The cherry blossoms have all turned green,

00:00:53.790 --> 00:00:58.950
and I'm already used to the steep slope in front of
the school gate and the new school new uniforms,

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:02.790
Yeah, I'm pretty much used to high school now.
I see. 
Sorry for rushing you,
but I want hear your reply soon

00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:02.790
if possible I'm waiting for it

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:04.200
but there's still one thing I left back in junior high...

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:06.250
Yuu?

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:08.830
Who're you talking to?

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:10.080
Uh, no one!

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:11.950
Did you have practice again this morning, Akari?

00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:12.660
Yep!

00:01:13.790 --> 00:01:18.000
Why don't you quit waffling around and pick something?
Recruitment is gonna end soon, you know!

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:20.910
Yeah, I know that, but...

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:23.500
Well then, how about track and field club?

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:25.910
I'm considering that one.

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:29.950
But there's also hand ball and badminton...

00:01:30.330 --> 00:01:33.620
And it's hard to give up the chance at
a culture club while in high school.

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:35.370
You're really indecisive.

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:38.040
Okay then, come to basketball club!

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:40.120
Won't that be a challenge at my height?

00:01:40.120 --> 00:01:41.750
No way, you can do it!

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:43.410
Hey, Koito! Yuu Koito!

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:44.830
Uh, yes?

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:48.790
If you haven't decided on a club yet,
how about the student council?

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:52.500
Huh? The student council?

00:01:52.790 --> 00:01:54.410
That seems kinda boring...

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:56.910
That's not how it is, though.

00:01:56.910 --> 00:02:01.870
Our student council is fairly active,
and I think it's just as fun as the clubs.

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:03.910
Student council, huh?

00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:06.750
Can I observe a meeting or something?

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:10.290
Oh, are you interested, then? That would be a huge help!

00:02:10.540 --> 00:02:12.750
Huh? "A huge help"?

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:17.410
Actually, the student council elections are coming up.

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:20.450
I was looking for students that could help out with that.

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:23.080
Man, what a huge help!

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:27.040
No way...

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:30.790
I think I got expertly tricked into doing this...

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:34.450
Field
☆ Here!!

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:34.450
School                                                   Woods
Gym

00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:34.500
Well, it's alright since I was curious anyways.

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:38.910
They said the student council room was here, but...

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:41.870
Sure is a strange place for it to be in...

00:02:42.250 --> 00:02:43.870
Where is it? Jeez...

00:02:43.870 --> 00:02:45.580
I'm sorry for calling you out here.

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:46.750
Huh?

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:48.790
Is there someone here?

00:02:52.120 --> 00:02:53.080
Over there!

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:55.200
Nanami... Will you...

00:02:56.370 --> 00:02:58.000
please go out with me?!

00:03:00.040 --> 00:03:01.160
I love you!

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:08.250
I'm sorry. I won't go out with you.

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:14.120
I see... I figured as much.

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:17.660
You and I don't suit each other at all...

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:21.500
Don't say that sort of thing. You shouldn't put
yourself down so harshly.

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:27.000
It's just that...

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:34.120
no matter who confesses to me,
I don't intend to go out with anyone.

00:03:41.910 --> 00:03:43.120
Well now, then...

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:45.910
Is someone over there?

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:50.250
Uh, I'm sorry! I didn't mean to eavesdrop!

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:53.290
I didn't really know when I could come out... I'm so sorry!

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:57.000
What you just saw... let's keep it a secret, okay?

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:58.620
Huh? R-right!

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:02.370
Are you a new student? What are you doing over here?

00:04:02.370 --> 00:04:07.660
Yes, I was looking for the student council room,
and I was told it's over here...

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:11.540
Oh, it's over there. It's hard to tell, though.

00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:25.040
The student council room was
a calligraphy classroom way back when.

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:26.370
Really?

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:29.750
She's a second year, huh?

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:35.620
But at our school right now,
our only fine arts classes are music and art, right?

00:04:35.950 --> 00:04:39.290
It seems like since no one uses it,
they let the student council have it.

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:41.120
You know a lot about this.

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:42.950
I suppose so.

00:04:44.410 --> 00:04:47.870
You're the first year who's come to help out today, right?

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:49.950
Huh? Uh, yes.

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:54.200
We're here.

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:55.450
What is this?

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:02.290
The student council room. And,

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:06.040
I'm Touko Nanami, from the student council.

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:07.750
Nice to meet you!

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:12.250
Nice to... meet you, too.

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:20.250
I didn't know baseball club
practices until that late 
Is it hard? 
It's harder than in junior high!
At the beginning we just ran
Wow

00:05:19.580 --> 00:05:20.290
Yuu!

00:05:21.290 --> 00:05:22.250
Hey, Yuu!

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:22.950
Huh?

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:25.000
Oh, sorry!

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:26.870
How was the student council?

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:29.870
They seem busy, but are you still gonna go?

00:05:29.870 --> 00:05:32.580
Hm, I'm still thinking about it.

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:35.660
Ah, oh yeah! There was a cool senpai there.

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:36.790
Whoa!

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:40.830
What's going on? It's like you're
finally interested in that sort of-

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:43.120
Oh, no, it was a girl senpai.

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:44.950
Oh, come on...

00:05:45.660 --> 00:05:47.540
Just as I thought.

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:53.500
But she's so cool! She's super talented,
and beautiful, and nice.

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:55.500
Her name's Nanami-senpai.

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:58.330
Oh, I've heard of her.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:01.410
She's been more popular than
the student council president since her first year.

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:05.620
But since you said "cool" I thought
you had to be talking about a guy.

00:06:05.620 --> 00:06:08.250
By the way Akari, how's the basketball club going?

00:06:08.580 --> 00:06:11.790
Oogaki-senpai was cool as always yesterday!

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:13.910
Not like I needed to ask you that, though.

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:17.950
People often choose high schools
because they're chasing boys, right?

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:20.080
Koyomi, you should join a club, too.

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:21.950
You might meet someone there!

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:25.250
I like 'em a lot older.

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:26.330
For real?

00:06:26.620 --> 00:06:27.620
What about you, Yuu?

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:30.870
I'm... not too sure.

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:34.500
And I thought we could finally do some girl talk, Yuu!

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:37.290
As is often the case with this type of thing, right?

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:45.200
On the day of the junior high graduation...

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:46.870
I was confessed to.

00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:51.910
Just how much older are you talking, though?!

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:52.830
I still haven't been able to reply.

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:53.910
Ten years... maybe twenty.

00:06:53.910 --> 00:06:54.830
What?!

00:06:54.830 --> 00:06:56.700
So you like old men?!

00:06:55.330 --> 00:06:59.910
I thought about talking to Akari and Koyomi about it.

00:07:01.370 --> 00:07:02.410
But...

00:07:19.950 --> 00:07:24.620
It's just that... no matter who confesses to me,
I don't intend to go out with anyone.

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:30.450
That senpai...

00:07:34.750 --> 00:07:35.910
All done.

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:41.160
Nanami-senpai, Saeki-senpai,
would you two like black tea or coffee?

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:43.830
Thank you. Black tea for me.

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:46.290
I'll have a coffee.

00:07:48.790 --> 00:07:49.750
Here you go.

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:50.750
Thank you.

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:57.200
We'll have to buy more sugar soon.

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:01.120
It's just a like a house here.

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:02.910
It's cozy, right?

00:08:02.910 --> 00:08:04.700
Yes. Very!

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:08.750
By the way, Touko, is it true
that someone confessed to you?

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:12.000
Huh? How do you know that, Sayaka?

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:15.250
My intelligence network is not to be underestimated!

00:08:15.950 --> 00:08:19.000
Well, I heard it straight from
the guy you rejected, though.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:21.200
Huh? What the heck...

00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:24.790
It isn't embarrassing at all to be rejected by you, Touko.

00:08:25.410 --> 00:08:28.370
There've been more than ten people
since you entered high school, I think...

00:08:28.790 --> 00:08:30.160
No one's got anything to lose, right?

00:08:30.370 --> 00:08:35.450
And if I give the OK after they come to me
with such a half-hearted attitude, then what?

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:38.870
You say that, but you'll just reject everyone anyways.

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:43.330
She's had girls confess to her too, you know.

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:44.290
What?!

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:47.000
S-so that's really happened, huh?

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:49.330
You don't have to tell her everything!

00:08:50.200 --> 00:08:53.830
Uh... Well... aside from the girls...

00:08:54.120 --> 00:08:58.040
Hasn't there ever been anyone
that you've been happy to be around?

00:08:59.410 --> 00:09:03.750
I think it's kind of my fault, but even so,
I don't get the interest.

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:08.000
Is there some reason for that?

00:09:08.910 --> 00:09:12.910
A reason, huh? The only thing it could be is...

00:09:16.040 --> 00:09:17.160
Well,

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:23.450
up until now, when someone's said
they like me, it's never made my heart flutter.

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:31.040
Um...

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:33.870
Um, about that...

00:09:33.870 --> 00:09:34.910
Excuse me!

00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:37.870
I'm interested in the student council.

00:09:37.870 --> 00:09:39.790
Oh, are you a first year?

00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:41.620
Did you come to observe?

00:09:41.620 --> 00:09:42.750
Is that okay?

00:09:42.750 --> 00:09:44.080
Please, come in.

00:09:45.450 --> 00:09:47.450
Fujishiro
Bookstore

00:09:53.450 --> 00:09:55.450
That's why it doesn't suit you
Rude

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:55.450
Time for dinner, see ya
Sorry this is late
I want you to answer me soon
Can I call after school tomorrow

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:00.950
Sorry to make you wait
But

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:05.500
Sorry to make you wait
Sure thing, tomorrow after school

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:07.000
Sorry to make you wait
Sure thing, tomorrow after school

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:09.000
Read

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:30.950
I Can't Reach the Star

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:39.540
My stomach was grumbling earlier!

00:10:39.540 --> 00:10:40.330
Yeah!

00:10:40.290 --> 00:10:46.830
Time for dinner, see ya
Sorry this is late
I want you to answer me soon
Can I call after school tomorrow
Sorry to make you wait
Sure thing, tomorrow after school

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:42.910
Yuu...

00:10:44.040 --> 00:10:45.160
Yuu?

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:46.700
Huh?

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:49.000
Did something happen?

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:54.500
Nope. Nothing at all.

00:10:55.790 --> 00:10:59.250
I'm sorry... But...

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:15.120
Not here yet, huh?

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:20.660
That's dumb of me, rushing to get here...

00:11:21.870 --> 00:11:23.620
You're early, Koito.

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:26.540
Outstanding!

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:28.250
Senpai...

00:11:33.700 --> 00:11:36.830
Sayaka said she's got things to do at home today,
so she won't be here.

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:40.410
Today the two of us will finish clearing up
the materials from the other-

00:11:39.620 --> 00:11:41.120
E-excuse me!

00:11:43.330 --> 00:11:47.830
Err... Wh-what about that guy?

00:11:48.370 --> 00:11:50.580
The first year that came here the other day...

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:51.290
No...

00:11:51.290 --> 00:11:55.120
Oh, him! He's going to come here to help out.

00:11:55.290 --> 00:11:57.000
He said he'd start tomorrow.

00:11:57.000 --> 00:12:00.700
That's not what I wanted to talk about...

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:02.910
That'll be a huge help.

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:05.540
I want you to enjoy yourself here too, Koito.

00:12:05.540 --> 00:12:06.870
I hope I can...

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:09.620
But, what should I say...

00:12:16.700 --> 00:12:18.250
Thank you very much!

00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:20.830
I'm sorry! I didn't notice you doing that!

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:26.950
I can at least make the tea.
I only have a few documents today. So...

00:12:28.410 --> 00:12:30.870
if you want to talk, I can take the time to listen to you.

00:12:30.870 --> 00:12:31.790
Huh?

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:35.830
Your face looks like you have something to say.

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:39.000
Nanami-senpai...

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:44.120
Replying to a confession, huh?

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:49.620
He really is serious, since he's waited an entire month...

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:50.870
Maybe.

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:56.660
But I don't know that guy.
I can't even consider if you should date him or not...

00:12:56.660 --> 00:13:00.540
Oh, that isn't it. I already know my answer.

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:01.580
Huh?

00:13:03.370 --> 00:13:08.830
I like him, but I think I'll turn him down.

00:13:11.410 --> 00:13:16.500
We were in the same class for three years,
and we talked a lot.

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:22.250
We've even hung out outside of school before,
and it was fun being with him.

00:13:23.080 --> 00:13:24.080
That's why...

00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:26.160
Koito!

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:26.950
Huh?

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:30.950
I wanna talk to you after graduation.

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:33.620
Oh? About what?

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:40.450
The love that I read about in books
and hear about in songs sparkles.

00:13:41.870 --> 00:13:49.410
For me, when that time comes,
I'm sure I'll float away like I've grown wings.

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:52.080
That's what I expect.

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:55.290
Koito... I love you.

00:13:55.950 --> 00:13:57.120
Will you go out with me?

00:14:00.790 --> 00:14:01.910
But...

00:14:03.540 --> 00:14:09.620
even though the time did come,
my feet stayed firmly on the ground.

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:11.500
Koito?

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:16.500
Why do you want to go out with me?

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:18.830
What do you mean "why"?

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:21.370
This type of thing is normal.

00:14:21.580 --> 00:14:26.830
I think you're a special person,
so I want to have a special relationship with you.

00:14:29.370 --> 00:14:32.620
Can you give me time to reply?

00:14:34.950 --> 00:14:36.330
It's okay.

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:41.040
I'm just a little slower than others
when it comes to sprouting wings.

00:14:42.160 --> 00:14:43.660
Surely, any moment now...

00:14:44.790 --> 00:14:46.080
Very soon...

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:49.000
But...

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:56.160
I wanted to be able to say "Let's date!" in reply.

00:14:57.620 --> 00:15:01.660
However, that special feeling...

00:15:02.120 --> 00:15:03.540
I don't understand it.

00:15:07.580 --> 00:15:08.910
You don't understand?

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:11.450
Right.

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:15.410
I couldn't even ask my friends about this...

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:17.870
It's never made my heart flutter.

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:21.750
I thought you might understand, Nanami-senpai.

00:15:23.830 --> 00:15:24.750
That's why-!

00:15:27.250 --> 00:15:28.450
Senpai?

00:15:29.870 --> 00:15:33.660
It's rough when you think that
you have to love someone, huh?

00:15:34.950 --> 00:15:37.910
That's because everyone loves
to talk about romance, right?

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:42.790
If you have no interest in it,
you even start to feel like you're a weirdo.

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:44.330
You too, Senpai?

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:52.750
I wonder... if I can say that as well as you did.

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:57.750
Is it from him?

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:09.910
It's okay.

00:16:11.830 --> 00:16:13.250
It's really okay.

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:19.330
You can tell him how you feel just
as well as he told you how he felt.

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:23.500
You're fine the way you are.

00:16:30.870 --> 00:16:31.910
Hello?

00:16:33.330 --> 00:16:37.080
In both shojo manga and love song lyrics,

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:40.910
it's so radiantly blinding to me.

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:47.580
But no matter what I do, I can't reach it.

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:52.410
I understand the meaning without
looking it up in the dictionary,

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:55.950
but it's something that will never be mine.

00:16:56.830 --> 00:16:57.790
I'm sorry!

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:01.080
Thank you.

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:08.040
Yeah. Thank you, from me too.

00:17:14.830 --> 00:17:16.500
Thank you so much.

00:17:16.910 --> 00:17:22.910
If you weren't here, I definitely...
couldn't have... said that.

00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:24.540
Huh?

00:17:25.330 --> 00:17:26.500
Yuu.

00:17:28.120 --> 00:17:35.500
I wasn't the one... whose hands were shaking
and whose palms were a bit sweaty...

00:17:36.540 --> 00:17:39.120
You said you don't understand the special feeling, right?

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:41.540
That's right.

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:45.830
You don't think anyone is special to you?

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:47.660
Right.

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:51.540
I'm sure no one-

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:53.410
Whoa!

00:17:55.620 --> 00:17:56.910
Nanami-senpai?

00:18:02.250 --> 00:18:04.160
Senpai... aren't you...

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:11.120
Senpai, aren't you the same as I am?

00:18:11.120 --> 00:18:13.830
No, I'm not. Because...

00:18:15.250 --> 00:18:16.330
Because...

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:19.790
I think I'm falling in love with you.

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:24.330
I don't understand.

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:29.080
Whatever this person is saying...

00:18:36.330 --> 00:18:37.580
I don't understand it.

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:43.120
Alright, thanks for your hard work on transferring
duties for the student council, everyone.

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:45.200
Now then, cheers!

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:46.500
Cheers!

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:50.200
President Kuse...

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:55.540
You haven't shown your face here until now,
so don't try to run everything until the very end.

00:20:56.000 --> 00:21:00.080
Now c'mon, I was busy with club activities and stuff.

00:21:00.080 --> 00:21:01.830
Just give me a break...

00:21:02.040 --> 00:21:04.160
I guess since I really don't have a choice...

00:21:04.410 --> 00:21:08.700
Now that I think about it, you showed up a lot back then, huh?

00:21:04.750 --> 00:21:10.000
There's been nothing since that happened,
but maybe I'm just worrying too much.

00:21:11.790 --> 00:21:12.580
But...

00:21:15.700 --> 00:21:17.040
Um...

00:21:17.950 --> 00:21:19.250
Nanami-senpai...

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:23.750
S-sorry, Koito!

00:21:24.580 --> 00:21:27.910
I got so weird all of a sudden! Please don't mind that.

00:21:27.910 --> 00:21:30.000
Well, we've got work to do!

00:21:33.870 --> 00:21:38.950
We're both girls, and I think
it was nothing I should worry about.

00:21:40.870 --> 00:21:41.830
But...

00:21:42.790 --> 00:21:45.160
she makes that face...

00:21:47.370 --> 00:21:49.660
Sorry for putting you guys straight to work!

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:51.290
You're a huge help.

00:21:51.500 --> 00:21:54.120
Uh, Maki and...

00:21:55.410 --> 00:21:57.500
Oh, was it Koito?

00:21:57.620 --> 00:22:00.750
I understood the spirit of the student council, so I'm glad!

00:22:01.120 --> 00:22:04.200
I hope I can go just like this and
become an officer... Just kidding.

00:22:04.200 --> 00:22:06.870
I guess that depends on you...

00:22:07.290 --> 00:22:09.370
Right, Future Student Council President?

00:22:09.540 --> 00:22:11.000
Did you finish getting everything together?

00:22:10.660 --> 00:22:11.500
Huh?

00:22:11.000 --> 00:22:11.790
It's all done!

00:22:12.250 --> 00:22:14.160
That hasn't been decided!

00:22:14.160 --> 00:22:16.200
The election hasn't happened yet.

00:22:16.200 --> 00:22:18.160
You're going to run though, right?

00:22:18.540 --> 00:22:20.250
It's pretty much already been decided, then.

00:22:20.620 --> 00:22:23.040
Don't speak so surely about that...

00:22:23.410 --> 00:22:25.290
It's a given for you, though.

00:22:25.540 --> 00:22:27.750
Koito, would you like some more juice?

00:22:28.370 --> 00:22:29.750
Uh, yes.

00:22:29.750 --> 00:22:30.790
Listen to me!

00:22:31.250 --> 00:22:32.500
Which one do you want?

00:22:32.500 --> 00:22:36.750
Uh, I had this one before, so I'll have this one.

00:22:37.200 --> 00:22:40.120
That Touko seems to be in high spirits about something.

00:22:40.500 --> 00:22:41.410
Really?

00:22:41.410 --> 00:22:44.750
Nanami-senpai, is going to become
a candidate after all, huh?

00:22:44.950 --> 00:22:48.250
She's been the face of the student council
since her first year.

00:22:48.620 --> 00:22:52.200
That's all thanks to a certain someone
pushing all the responsibility onto her...

00:22:54.540 --> 00:22:58.290
Saeki-senpai, did you never think
about becoming president?

00:22:58.290 --> 00:23:04.500
I'm fine. I'd like to continue supporting
Touko as I always have.

00:23:05.290 --> 00:23:08.080
Senpai, you're going to be in the elections, huh?

00:23:08.080 --> 00:23:10.750
Yes. I've already come this far.

00:23:11.200 --> 00:23:13.290
So, about the elections...

00:23:13.580 --> 00:23:14.500
Yeah?

00:23:14.700 --> 00:23:20.200
I need someone to be in charge of the nomination,
and do election campaign activities with me.

00:23:21.200 --> 00:23:22.160
Okay...?

00:23:24.620 --> 00:23:27.000
Can I ask you to do that for me?

00:23:28.540 --> 00:23:29.330
What?

00:23:32.790 --> 00:23:34.000
I knew it...

00:23:35.040 --> 00:23:36.370
I don't...

00:23:38.540 --> 00:23:40.160
understand this girl.
